:name: Factory Control Unit revision 3 (STM32H743) on the host network
:description: fcu_rev3.resc plus Ethernet: the FCU is connected through a switch to the TAP adapter "rtoos-tap" (192.168.77.1/24 on the host, see setup-tap.ps1).

$tap?="rtoos-tap"

include $ORIGIN/fcu_rev3.resc

emulation CreateSwitch "switch"
connector Connect sysbus.ethernet switch
emulation CreateTap $tap "tap"
connector Connect host.tap switch
